<p style='color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>{{#if firstName}}Hello {{firstName}},{{else}}Hello,{{/if}}</p>
<p style='color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>{{pendingCount}} AI insight actions are waiting for your decision in AI Insights. None of them runs until an operator confirms it.</p>
{{#if stuckSessionsCount}}<p style='color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>Stop a stuck charging session: {{stuckSessionsCount}}</p>{{/if}}
{{#if networkSummaryCount}}<p style='color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>From the network health summary: {{networkSummaryCount}}</p>{{/if}}
{{#if siteNames}}<p style='color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>Sites: {{siteNames}}</p>{{/if}}
<table cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' border='0' width='100%' style='border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;'><tr><td align='center' style='padding:24px 0;'><a href='{{insightsUrl}}' style='display:inline-block;background-color:#2563eb;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;'>Open AI Insights</a></td></tr></table>
<p style='color:#6b7280;line-height:1.6;margin:0;font-size:14px;'>Actions expire when nobody confirms them. You receive this summary because you turned on the daily AI insight action digest in your profile.</p>
